    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can perform an esoteric rite for 1 minute. At the end of it, you regain expended Pact Magic spell slots but no more than a number equal to half your maximum (round up). Once you use this feature, you can’t do so again until you finish a Long Rest.</p><section id=\"secret-uXJIaDc9mWHsrILV\" class=\"secret\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>This feature includes one free use and will restore the correct number of Pact Magic spell slots.</p></section>",
